WEBVTT

00:00:00.644 --> 00:00:08.143
Open the WQ-LS machine. This clip practises the mouse: pan, rotate, zoom, then standard views and selecting parts

00:00:08.143 --> 00:00:13.418
The status bar shows "CAD": the CAD navigation style (the WenQuest CAD default)

00:00:13.418 --> 00:00:17.024
CAD navigation: hold the middle button and drag = pan

00:00:17.024 --> 00:00:21.219
Hold the middle button, then the left button, and drag = rotate

00:00:21.219 --> 00:00:26.343
Wheel = zoom: forward to zoom in, back to zoom out (around the mouse position)

00:00:26.343 --> 00:00:31.493
Lost the view? Click "Fit all" and the whole machine comes back to the centre

00:00:31.493 --> 00:00:38.018
Navigation cube: click the Front face to look from the front; click a corner for an isometric view

00:00:38.018 --> 00:00:44.443
Or use the keyboard: 0 isometric, 1 front, 2 top, 3 right

00:00:44.443 --> 00:00:53.120
Left-click a part: it turns green and its data shows in the properties; click empty space to deselect
